(Demonstrate that a program can be resumed with proper G92 settings)
o<open_startline_logfile> call (Opens a named log file depending on start line)
G90 G20 G17 G54 G91.1
M6 T1 G43 H1
G92.1
G20 
G56
G0 Z1
G0 X1 Y1
G0 Z0
G92 Z0
o<pocket_pass> call
G92 Z0
o<pocket_pass> call
G92 Z0
o<pocket_pass> call
(Start on the next line, should execute only the last two passes)
o<log_modal_state> call (logs modal state at start line for comparison)
(debug, Z axis offset: expect -2, got #<_axis_offset_z>)
(debug, Z position: expect -1, got #<_z>)
G92 Z0
o<pocket_pass> call

M6 T0 G49
M2

o<pocket_pass> sub
(Each pass drops by 1 inch)
G1 Z-1 F1000
G1 X3 F4000
G3 X4 Y2 R1
G1 Y3
G3 X3 Y4 R1
G1 X1
Y1
o<pocket_pass> endsub
%
